  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in comfort with our personalized Book Lover Blanket, exclusively from Jeminise. This thoughtful and personal blanket is designed for anyone who cherishes the joy of reading, making it a perfect addition to any cozy reading nook or a heartfelt gift.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A unique and thoughtful present for book lovers, ideal for showcasing their passion for reading on special occasions or as a surprise.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize your blanket by adding unique details such as skin color, hairstyle, and name, creating a truly one-of-a-kind item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from four convenient sizes: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to find your perfect cozy fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a modern design with a letter print pattern and a book theme, adding warmth and style to any space.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This blanket is machine washable, ensuring simple and convenient maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Offers personalization through text input, allowing you to add a custom name or message.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</table>",
